    "created_at": "2026-07-24T18:06:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-24T18:06:57Z",
    "body": "Also, it was very important for me to slot spans and divs in this case because there were websites which had html like that, with options inside divs and spans, and they were relying on the old HTML parser which would remove the divs and spans in order to make the slotting work. When changing the parser, we also had to allow these elements to be slotted in order to not break those websites.\n\nI agree that we could specify slotting. There is slotting specified for base appearance in the rendering section, but I don't think that we are specifying what gets slotted for appearance:auto?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/5072984515/reactions",
