    "created_at": "2026-07-24T18:12:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-24T18:12:11Z",
    "body": "I guess slotting for base appearance right now says text should be slotted, right?\n\n> A select popover slot, which is a [slot](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-slot-element) element. It is appended to the [select popover](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#select-popover). It is [expected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#expected) to take all child nodes of the [select](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-select-element) except for the first child [button](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-button-element), which is taken by the [select button slot](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#select-button-slot).\n\nI think slotting decisions shouldn't depend on style, so that should also apply to `appearance: auto`.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
