    "updated_at": "2026-07-30T16:18:57Z",
    "body": "Discussion in the WHATWG meeting agreed with @emilio's request - we should make text behave the same as spans here. (In general, CSS tries to ensure that inserting an unstyled span or div shouldn't meaningfully change your page, and HTML should probably lean in that direction as much as it reasonably can as well.)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
